{"spec": "ACP v1. Prompt turn: session/cancel is a notification; the client answers pending session/request_permission with outcome cancelled; the agent answers session/prompt with stopReason cancelled (https://agentclientprotocol.com/protocol/prompt-turn, Cancellation). Permission: options with optionId, kind allow_once or reject_once, outcome selected or cancelled (schema v1 RequestPermissionRequest, RequestPermissionOutcome)."}
{"event": "connect", "cwd": "/home/user/project", "at": 0, "expect": [{"send": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 1, "method": "initialize", "params": {"protocolVersion": 1, "clientCapabilities": {"fs": {"readTextFile": true, "writeTextFile": true}, "terminal": false}, "clientInfo": {"name": "rvim", "version": "<any>"}}}}], "state": "Initializing"}
{"event": "bytes", "at": 5, "in": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 1, "result": {"protocolVersion": 1, "agentCapabilities": {"loadSession": false}, "authMethods": []}}, "expect": [{"send": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 2, "method": "session/new", "params": {"cwd": "/home/user/project", "mcpServers": []}}}], "state": "Initializing"}
{"event": "bytes", "at": 10, "in": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 2, "result": {"sessionId": "sess_abc123"}}, "expect": [{"notice": "connected", "session": "sess_abc123"}], "state": "Ready"}
{"event": "prompt", "at": 20, "text": "Rewrite src/a.rs", "expect": [{"send": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 3, "method": "session/prompt", "params": {"sessionId": "sess_abc123", "prompt": [{"type": "text", "text": "Rewrite src/a.rs"}]}}}, {"notice": "turn_started", "turn": 1}], "state": "Prompting"}
{"event": "bytes", "at": 30, "in": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 100, "method": "session/request_permission", "params": {"sessionId": "sess_abc123", "toolCall": {"toolCallId": "call_2", "title": "Write src/a.rs", "kind": "edit", "status": "pending"}, "options": [{"optionId": "allow", "name": "Allow", "kind": "allow_once"}, {"optionId": "reject", "name": "Reject", "kind": "reject_once"}]}}, "expect": [{"ask_permission": {"tool": "Write src/a.rs", "options": ["allow", "reject"], "queued": 1}}], "state": "Prompting"}
{"event": "cancel", "at": 40, "expect": [{"send": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "method": "session/cancel", "params": {"sessionId": "sess_abc123"}}}, {"send": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 100, "result": {"outcome": {"outcome": "cancelled"}}}}, {"notice": "cancel_sent", "turn": 1}], "state": "Cancelling"}
{"event": "bytes", "at": 45, "in": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 3, "result": {"stopReason": "cancelled"}}, "expect": [{"notice": "turn_ended", "turn": 1, "stop": "cancelled"}], "state": "Ready"}
